doc:comparisonDescription opmad:has_text_value "Algorithms were compared on the same twenty testing units. KF state propagation improves mean accuracy and compacts RUL error ranges. AEKFOS-ELM with LR has a lower score and better RUL estimation performance than KFOS-ELM. The prose reports higher average time for KFOS-ELM and AEKFOS-ELM than traditional OS-ELM and EOS-ELM; numeric times are retained independently." .
_:ef08c9d1d8224c12ed0ac9f4e3bbec2a rdf:reifies <<( doc:comparisonDescription opmad:has_text_value "Algorithms were compared on the same twenty testing units. KF state propagation improves mean accuracy and compacts RUL error ranges. AEKFOS-ELM with LR has a lower score and better RUL estimation performance than KFOS-ELM. The prose reports higher average time for KFOS-ELM and AEKFOS-ELM than traditional OS-ELM and EOS-ELM; numeric times are retained independently." )>> ;
